where the Software can be reached from.  You are responsible for the results.

## 7. Network use and privacy

The Software runs on your computer.  It checks a notices file on
functional-development.com from time to time to tell you about new versions.
That request carries the Software's version and, like any web request, your
network address;  it carries nothing about your work, and you can turn it off
in Preferences.  When you ask the Software to install a program it depends on,
it downloads that program from its publisher.  We do not collect your prompts,
files, keys or usage.

